// Ch5 B01 "The ferry comes in" (docs/kb/story/beats/act1_ch05.md). In-engine. The Brightwater ferry
// noses into Pemakar's harbour at day 1, 19:10; above it every terrace channel is being dressed with
// small fires. P01 from the water: the ferry-master carries Ch4's drowned trader's name-board ashore
// first, to the harbour wake-wall (no line). The ferry-master is Imbe (Ch4); the `ferryman` actor wears his
// body, and the chapter flow takes the board out of the bag after this scene (M4-A2P-116 B3). P02 on the gangplank: N-01, Rhen sees Asha's first
// reach-band on her left forearm. Then Ysolde with the Tenders' letter. ch05_arrived follows in the
// chapter flow. Grade: the ch05 night frame until Art builds ch05_harbour_dusk.
title: ch05_ferry_comes_in
location: ch05/pemakar
---
@music pemakar_terraces fade=3.0
@camera P01
@fade in 2.0
@anim ferryman carry_name_board
@mark ferryman wake_wall walk
@wait 2.5
@camera P02
@anim rhen look_at asha
Rhen [surprised]: That's new. #line:ch05_ferry_001
@anim asha touch_forearm
Asha [soft_smile]: My first. Toma's hand shook. #line:ch05_ferry_002
Toma [neutral]: It did not. #line:ch05_ferry_003
@anim ysolde read_letter
Ysolde [neutral]: The Tenders write that the trial is at noon tomorrow, "when the plume is awake." #line:ch05_ferry_004
Ysolde [neutral]: Tonight is Lanternfall. #line:ch05_ferry_005
@camera release
===
